## What exists already (verify it yourself)
- `npm run build:itch` builds a self-contained release in `dist/itch/` (index.html at the root, bundled game.js and game.css, packed assets) and zips it to `dist/alva-itch.zip`. `npm run verify:itch` checks it.
- Save data lives in localStorage (js/core/settings.js).
- Online play goes to a Cloudflare Worker room server with Durable Objects (server/). It only accepts the browser origins listed in `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` in server/wrangler.toml, currently itch.io domains plus localhost. The server URL comes from `CONFIG.online.serverUrl`.
